| $\Lambda$ | $f(H_1)$ at $P$ | $f(H_1)$ at $P'$ | $f(S3c[1,2])$ at $P$ | at $P'$ |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| $[2,1,0]$ | $6+4/\theta_{12}$ | $\tfrac{23}6+4/\theta_{12}$ | $2$ | $-\tfrac32$ |
